WEBVTT

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:10.530
We're here?

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.070
No, we aren't...

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.820
This isn't Uranus.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.370
I've got it.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.960
What we're seeing is the seventh moon, Hyperion.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.460
We're in orbit around Saturn.

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:28.800
We're still a bit far away...

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.930
Hana, can we Entangle Link again?

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:35.760
Yeah.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.720
I think so.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.390
I'll start getting ready now.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.520
Thanks.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.310
But why did we fail?

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.570
You and I might be the cause, Captain.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:51.650
Us?

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:57.280
Our minds weren't used to the Entangle Link.
That could've caused interference.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:03.620
The minds of the crew can interfere
with the hyperspace jump.

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:08.840
There are also signs we're being
affected by external interference.

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:11.960
Come to think of it, I had a weird dream.

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:17.090
It was like they were locking me inside my dream,

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:19.800
and trying to keep me there.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.060
Same here.

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:26.060
We should assume that was a
psychological attack by the enemy.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.980
Kill-T-Gang in sector 79.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:34.780
Distance: .03 AU.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.110
Captain, they're coming!

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:47.420
I'll stop it!

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:52.300
Bagbear?

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.550
The captain will be in danger alone!

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:55.590
I'll go, too.

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:58.430
Teppei, use the Boosted.

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:00.680
Take care of the captain!

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:01.510
Roger.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.330
This overwhelming force...

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:26.790
The champion?

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.500
Manatsu Daichi...

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:37.920
I thought you didn't want to be the captain.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.680
He's infiltrated our communications...

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.510
That isn't all.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:43.850
They...

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.310
They really <i>were</i> inside my dream.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:55.780
Manatsu Daichi, are you really awake right now?

00:02:56.940 --> 00:03:02.280
This might still be part of your nightmare!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.500
Don't let him fool you, Captain!

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.090
I'll scramble our communications.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.470
The backdoor I used on them last time...

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.510
I guess I can't use it anymore.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:26.890
Your lives don't even last a century.
That's no different from a dream!

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:30.140
They end quickly, and you lose everything!

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:33.310
What is something like that worth?

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:39.240
Why are you the one to decide if our
lives are worth anything or not?!

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:54.290
This is the extent of your power.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:59.510
Those without power can't protect anything.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.840
I know you are a special person.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:08.510
Live in a way that lets you see the true light...

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.230
Like me.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:17.270
Earthlings are meaningless creatures.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.480
I'll kill them all!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.830
Can you hear me, Captain?

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.330
I'm gonna use the Boosted.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:33.620
Get away from Bagbear,
or you'll be caught in the blast!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:34.830
Roger.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:42.550
It doesn't matter what you try to do, Manatsu Daichi!

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:46.510
Captain!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:02.900
Captain!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.080
You are helpless.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:19.340
Against overwhelming power,

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:23.710
your desire to protect something is meaningless.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.090
Feelings are powerless.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:27.930
No...

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.180
Power doesn't come first.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.020
Your feelings come first.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:41.440
The strength of your feelings becomes your power.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.400
Captain...

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.280
That's why he'll be fine.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.780
Is that what you mean by strength?

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:51.870
But...

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:57.580
Once you're dead, everything is over!

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.540
Give me the power to protect my friends, too...

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:04.710
God!

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:11.760
What?

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.560
The captain is correct, Bagbear.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:26.490
We've always turned the strength
of our emotions into power!

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.700
Albion?!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.460
The Nebula Engine Entangle Linked?

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.760
Yeah, that's how it looked to me.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.680
Are you okay?

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:52.850
You look really beat.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.510
I didn't realize it.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:07:00.190
But I guess I really did jump.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.810
Your Ego Block is gone now, isn't it?

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:04.480
Yeah.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:09.150
But even without our Ego Blocks
or spaceships like <i>Blume</i>,

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:11.950
it was said that a Neoteny

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:15.830
could also Entangle Link, depending
on how they used the Livlaster.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:20.000
Then it was you that jumped, not the Nebula?

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:24.790
The Livlasters are devices capable
of Entangle Links, too?

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:31.470
When the Nebula Engine was hit by the
Boosted Plazmagnum, the reason it survived

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:36.510
must be because it phase shifted, via Entangle Link.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.600
Well, anyway...

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.860
When you tried to protect the
captain, you powered up.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.070
You two boys really are in love.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.860
For a second, I was praying to God.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:59.080
I think, for the first time,
I found a God I want to believe in.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.460
Thanks to you.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.420
If you did it, can I do it, too?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.050
I love the way you can't stand to lose.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:15.550
Hey, you said they were inside your dream, right?

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:21.730
Yeah, during the Entangle Link, they were
trying to shake me up inside my dream.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.690
Is that really possible?

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:28.230
They have Ego Blocks, so I don't think it's impossible.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:34.320
If they've prioritized stopped Operation Summer over attacking the Earth,

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:35.700
then why?

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:44.040
They've realized that with our power now, we can destroy the Cocoon inside <i>Oberon</i>.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:49.300
The Cocoon at <i>Oberon</i>'s center
contains the safeguard systems

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:53.420
for the Ego Blocks, and the core of the
mechanical intelligence controlling <i>Oberon</i>.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:57.760
But there's another reason they
wouldn't want it destroyed.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.010
That's right.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:05.850
On their own, the Kill-T-Gangs can't Entangle
Link through interstellar distances, right?

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:06.770
Yeah.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:10.360
If they lose the Cocoon, even if
their Ego Blocks are intact,

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.650
they wouldn't be able to leave the Solar System.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.400
That explosion was really huge, wasn't it?

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:16.860
Yeah.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.870
If you hadn't been there, it would've been bad.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:22.620
We destroyed Bagbear's Ego Block.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:27.630
With the Boosted Plazmagnum,
destroying Ego Blocks is possible.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:28.830
Yeah.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:33.960
We'll destroy all the Kill-T-Gangs and the Cocoon.

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.090
Captain...

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:39.720
I'm ready.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:45.560
Roger.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.020
You gonna be okay this time, Captain?

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:51.610
They may attack again.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.360
What about you, Akari?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:55.860
I'm a magical girl, after all.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.240
I'll be fine, too.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:01.200
No matter what happens,
I'll do the best I can right now.

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:02.700
That's all.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.750
We're jumping to <i>Oberon</i>!

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:16.130
Oberon

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.610
We're here.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:12.870
Earth Engine!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:15.460
Nebula Engine!

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.090
Scramble!

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.800
That's the <i>Oberon</i>?

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:26.930
It's bigger than I'd imagined.

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.890
Okay...

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:32.020
I'll take over the <i>Kivotos</i>!

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:33.520
Let's go with <i>that</i>.

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:35.980
We're doing <i>that</i>?

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:36.730
We're doing <i>that</i>.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:38.980
Okay, Captain?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.070
Roger.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.360
You're ready, aren't you, partner?

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.110
Let's go.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.570
Okay, guys!

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:50.080
Pirate formation! Go!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:27.660
Captain!

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.120
They're still coming.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:32.160
Roger!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:45.630
We're going in!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.960
Captain, we're heading into the core.

00:14:56.870 --> 00:15:00.120
This is the Cocoon?

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.340
I'm ending this.

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:11.800
Above me?

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.640
It's them!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:19.520
They ambushed us!

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:27.990
Akari!

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.190
I'm fine!

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:30.530
Concentrate!

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:34.320
Welcome back, Albion.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:39.040
And Earthlings, you've done well to come this far.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:40.790
To be honest, I'm surprised.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:45.750
I can't believe you Earthlings can
perform an Entangle Link.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.750
What is this voice?

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.720
It isn't coming in via the communicator.

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:52.010
It's resonating throughout the <i>Oberon</i>.

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.350
I have a proposal for you.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:58.520
You were able to withstand an Entangle Link,

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:01.270
and your growth as Neoteny has been impressive.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.270
You're becoming very similar to us.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:09.820
So I'd like to have you join us.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:13.360
Lady Seiren can do that.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.420
Bagbear, awaken.

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.040
Welcome back, Bagbear.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:11.090
I thank you, Lady Seiren.

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:14.260
His Ego Block regenerated?

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:17.340
You understand, don't you, Albion?

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:23.100
An Ego Block can only be recreated in the Cocoon as long as the avatar is alive.

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.640
Of course, that goes not just for you.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:30.360
We can give Ego Blocks to the Princess
of <i>Blume</i> or to the Earthlings.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:34.070
We can welcome you into the Planetary Gears.

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.780
But abandon your Livlasters!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:42.240
They are life forms that cannot be held
by someone with an Ego Block.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.830
I'm serious.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:50.710
I can make you, and only you, true humans.

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:06.770
Your energy's mine, and now I'm invincible!

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.030
Akari! Hana!

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.550
Then negotiations have failed?

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:38.130
They wouldn't listen to a plan like that.

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:43.310
They're already being controlled by the
extradimensional creatures called Livlasters.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:49.640
First, you should destroy the Earthling
weapons that pose a threat to me.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:53.440
What do you mean by "a threat to me"?

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:57.030
I mean this, ancient Princess...

00:18:58.820 --> 00:18:59.570
Lady Seiren!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:04.990
What is this light?

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:08.910
Liban?

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:13.500
Lady Seiren, I'm so glad you're safe.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.510
Something's wrong...

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.920
I can't move!

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:21.130
Liban!

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:26.640
What?

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:37.940
Teppei!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.490
I'm fine!

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:42.200
But the Boosted was destroyed.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:45.580
Liban's Ego Block exploded?

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.700
What's going on?

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:50.160
Did you do that, Pac?

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:51.870
What did you do?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:56.880
The part of a Planetary Gear's
Kill-T-Gang body capable of

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:00.550
generating the most destructive
energy is the Ego Block.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:04.260
So I used it for my own purposes.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:06.560
A very logical decision.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:10.180
You're a tool of the Planetary Gears.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.440
And you used us as tools?

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:18.690
I already have a system that can install

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:23.570
my own ego into a Planetary
Gear's Kill-T-Gang at any time.

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:27.990
Now <i>you</i> are no more than <i>my</i> tools.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.160
So that's what's going on.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:35.500
The sudden change in Kube Masaki was
because you installed your ego in him?

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.920
That's right.

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:43.380
What the hell are you doing?

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:45.340
Stop!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:57.360
I can install my ego into an Earthling or
a Planetary Gear whenever I want.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:03.360
Even the Cocoon you're
protecting is a part of me now.

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:03.990
Then...

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.240
What are you doing, Manatsu Daichi?

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:13.580
I'll just destroy it, as well!

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:16.630
Can you do that?

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:22.210
I will!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:30.350
What?

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:49.280
The Cocoon...

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:56.290
Did I get him?

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:05.760
Earthlings are so emotional.

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:10.550
They're so easy to manipulate.

00:22:10.550 --> 00:22:14.930
Now every threat to me has been eliminated.

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:18.730
What is that?

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:27.200
I'll install myself into every
sentient life form in the galaxy,

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:31.740
and become this galaxy's true God!

00:24:14.140 --> 00:24:17.850
The mechanical intelligence Pac
installs himself into <i>Blume</i>,

00:24:17.850 --> 00:24:21.980
transforming into a massive weapon
of destruction, Robin Goodfellow.

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:25.060
Its power overwhelms the Midsummer's Knights,

00:24:25.060 --> 00:24:27.690
and attacks their home, Earth.

00:24:27.690 --> 00:24:31.990
But the boy who chose his fate
does not give up the fight.

00:24:32.570 --> 00:24:35.700
Next time, <i>Captain Earth</i>, final episode:

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:36.990
Captain Earth.

00:24:36.990 --> 00:24:42.000
Captain Earth

00:24:38.370 --> 00:24:40.910
Captain, thank you.
